WEBVTT

00:16:29.388 --> 00:16:31.996
There's no difference
in socioeconomic status.

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:33.171
In my experience,

00:16:33.195 --> 00:16:36.080
the only difference between morning
people and evening people

00:16:36.104 --> 00:16:38.605
is that those people that get up
in the morning early

00:16:38.629 --> 00:16:39.921
are just horribly smug.

00:16:39.945 --> 00:16:41.216
(Laughter)

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:44.543
(Applause)

00:16:44.567 --> 00:16:45.719
OK.

00:16:45.743 --> 00:16:47.269
So for the last few minutes,

00:16:47.293 --> 00:16:49.166
what I want to do is change gears

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:52.939
and talk about some really new,
breaking areas of neuroscience,

00:16:52.963 --> 00:16:55.847
which is the association
between mental health,

00:16:55.871 --> 00:16:58.165
mental illness and sleep disruption.

00:16:58.189 --> 00:17:02.289
We've known for 130 years
that in severe mental illness,